{"step_index":781,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-21T15:07:10Z","content":"The playbook [`playbooks/audit-wextp-topology.yml`](file:///home/koby/LINUX/playbooks/audit-wextp-topology.yml) has been created and validated end-to-end with **100% success across all 14 nodes** (`fe1..fe3`, `be1..be11`).\n\nAll 11 backend nodes have also been provisioned with `koby-bowser-ansible` for passwordless Ed25519 SSH and NOPASSWD sudo, and declared in [`inventory/hosts.ini`](file:///home/koby/LINUX/inventory/hosts.ini).\n\n---\n\n### Execution Flow & Architecture\n\n```mermaid\nflowchart TD\n    A[\"ansible-playbook -i inventory/hosts.ini playbooks/audit-wextp-topology.yml\"] --> B[\"Phase 1: import_playbook kdbx-pool.yml\"]\n    B --> C[\"Query KeePass pool for trp-wextp-be & ensure dynamic inventory\"]\n    C --> D[\"Phase 2: Front-End Inspection (fe1, fe2, fe3)\"]\n    D --> E[\"Parse /etc/nginx/omt/fpm_cluster.conf & /etc/nginx/sites-enabled/*\"]\n    E --> F[\"Resolve Domain -> Upstream Pool -> Target BE Node(s) & Port(s)\"]\n    F --> G[\"Phase 3: Back-End Inspection (be1 to be11)\"]\n    G --> H[\"Check PHP CLI, Active PHP-FPM Services & Listening TCP Ports\"]\n    G --> I[\"Check ProxySQL Service Status, Version, Config & Ports (6032/6033/6080)\"]\n    G --> J[\"Scan /var/www/* Root Directories & Match Routed Domains\"]\n    J --> K[\"Phase 4: Consolidated Cross-Cluster Topology Tables\"]\n```\n\n---\n\n### 1. Front-End to Back-End Domain Routing Topology Table\n\n| Front-End | Hosted Domain(s) | Upstream Pool | Target Backend Node(s) | BE Port | FE Root Directory |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **`trp-wextp-fe1`** | `commande.sfrcaraibe.fr`, `commande.sfrcaraibe.com` | `SFRDEV82` | `trp-wextp-be11` | `18200` (PHP 8.2) | `/var/www/commande.sfrcaraibe.fr` |\n| **`trp-wextp-fe1`** | `espaceclient-lapostemobile.sfrcaraibe.fr` | `SFRDEV82` | `trp-wextp-be11` | `18200` (PHP 8.2) | `/var/www/espaceclient-lapostemobile.sfrcaraibe.fr` |\n| **`trp-wextp-fe1`** | `espaceclient.sfrcaraibe.fr`, `espaceclient.sfrcaraibe.com` | `SFRPROD74` | `trp-wextp-be6, be7, be8, be9, be10` | `17400` (PHP 7.4) | `/var/www/espaceclient.sfrcaraibe.fr` |\n| \n<truncated 5321 bytes>\n30.119` | `8.5.3` | `php7.4-fpm`, `php8.2-fpm`, `php8.3-fpm` | `17400, 18200, 18202, 18203, 18205, 18207, 18208, 27400, 28202, 28204` | **ACTIVE** (v2.7.3) | `6032, 6033, 6080` | **35 roots** |\n| **`trp-wextp-be8`** | `172.30.230.120` | `8.5.3` | `php7.4-fpm`, `php8.2-fpm`, `php8.3-fpm` | `17400, 18200, 18202, 18203, 18205, 18207, 18208, 27400, 28202, 28204` | **ACTIVE** (v2.7.3) | `6032, 6033, 6080` | **35 roots** |\n| **`trp-wextp-be9`** | `172.30.230.121` | `8.5.3` | `php7.4-fpm`, `php8.2-fpm`, `php8.3-fpm` | `17400, 18200, 18202, 18203, 18205, 18207, 18208, 27400, 28202, 28204` | **ACTIVE** (v2.7.3) | `6032, 6033, 6080` | **35 roots** |\n| **`trp-wextp-be10`** | `172.30.230.122` | `8.5.3` | `php7.4-fpm`, `php8.2-fpm`, `php8.3-fpm` | `17400, 18200, 18202, 18203, 18205, 18207, 18208, 27400, 28202, 28204` | **ACTIVE** (v2.7.3) | `6032, 6033, 6080` | **39 roots** |\n| **`trp-wextp-be11`** | `172.30.230.123` | `8.4.14` | `php7.4-fpm`, `php8.2-fpm` | `17400, 18200, 27400` | **ACTIVE** (v2.7.3) | `6032, 6033, 6080` | **42 roots** |\n\n---\n\n### 3. Key Findings\n\n1. **ProxySQL**: 100% operational across all 11 backends with `6032` (admin), `6033` (MySQL traffic proxy), and `6080` (HTTP metrics).\n2. **PHP-FPM Architecture**:\n   - `17400` / `27400`: PHP 7.4 legacy pools.\n   - `18200` / `28200` / `28202` / `28204`: PHP 8.2 modern pools.\n   - `be6..be10` also have `php8.3-fpm.service` active.\n3. **Backend Workload Specialization**:\n   - **`be1..be3`**: RED Caraïbe workloads (`uxui.redcaraibe.fr` on `28200`, `pay` on `28210`).\n   - **`be4..be5`**: Résiliation pools (`27404`).\n   - **`be6..be10`**: Core SFR production cluster (`SFRPROD74`, `SFRUXUIPROD82`, `PAYSFRUXUIPROD82`, `SELFCAREBIZPROD83`).\n   - **`be11`**: Specialized staging/dev workloads (`SFRDEV82` servicing `commande`, `rechargement`, `sso`).\n\nWould you like me to commit [`inventory/hosts.ini`](file:///home/koby/LINUX/inventory/hosts.ini) and [`playbooks/audit-wextp-topology.yml`](file:///home/koby/LINUX/playbooks/audit-wextp-topology.yml) to the `Baba-Koby` branch?","truncated_fields":["content"]}
